# Odds API ban

The live book is Betfair Exchange. Do not call The Odds API from an engine, a script, or a rehearsal.

## Do not

- Read or write `ODDS_API_KEY`.
- Request `the-odds-api.com`, including props, discovery, historical, or calibrate endpoints.
- Open `data/live/gw_lines.csv` as a live slate. That file is the frozen holdout and stays byte-for-byte.
- Treat a missing Betfair folder as permission to use the frozen slate.

## Live prices

Write a pull with `python3 -m src.live.betfair_lines --out <predictions/gwNN/betfair_*>`. Readers take `gw_lines.csv` only from that folder. Historical 1X2 for the published climb stays the football-data.co.uk E0 files already on disk.
